WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
Three spellings: «mangé»,
«manger», «mangez».

2
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.810
Listen again. How many
different sounds did you hear?

3
00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.770
Now «tu» and «tout».

4
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.740
They look almost the same.

5
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.870
To a French ear, they're
two different words.

6
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.980
So what is that ear picking up?

7
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:20.220
And how do those little
marks over letters tell

8
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.860
you what to say?

9
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:25.430
In this mission, you'll tap
out the beat of French words.

10
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.620
Then you'll meet five
accent cards and sort words

11
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.560
by ear in the lab.

12
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.290
Your mission: find out what a
French ear is listening for,

13
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.600
and let the accents tell you how to speak.
